      "found_by": [
        "llm-atomic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_range": "L184",
      "text": "In GeoDeploy, Jev is left to decide ingress posture, autoscaling posture, and node-pool sizing tier as open module choices.",
      "type": "behavior",
      "source_hint": "pulumi/devx-geodeploy",
      "confidence": "medium",
      "file": "content/blog/self-driving-infrastructure-pulumi-jev/index.md",
      "found_by": [
        "llm-atomic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_range": "L188",
      "text": "In GeoDeploy, every Jev answer is checked against a confidence threshold matched to how risky the decision is.",
      "type": "behavior",
      "source_hint": "pulumi/devx-geodeploy",
      "confidence": "high",
      "file": "content/blog/self-driving-infrastructure-pulumi-jev/index.md",
      "found_by": [
        "llm-atomic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_range": "L192",
      "text": "In GeoDeploy, the data-residency confidence threshold is 0.95, and failing it results in a hard reject.",
      "type": "numerical",
      "source_hint": "pulumi/devx-geodeploy",
      "confidence": "high",
      "file": "content/blog/self-driving-infrastructure-pulumi-jev/index.md",
      "found_by": [
        "llm-atomic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_range": "L193",
      "text": "In GeoDeploy, the confidence threshold for the region of a new cluster is 0.90, and failing it flags the top three candidates for a human to choose.",
      "type": "numerical",
      "source_hint": "pulumi/devx-geodeploy",
      "confidence": "high",
      "file": "content/blog/self-driving-infrastructure-pulumi-jev/index.md",
      "found_by": [
        "llm-atomic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_range": "L194",
      "text": "In GeoDeploy, the confidence threshold for the region when a stack already exists is 0.75, and failing it keeps the existing region.",
      "type": "numerical",
      "source_hint": "pulumi/devx-geodeploy",
      "confidence": "high",
      "file": "content/blog/self-driving-infrastructure-pulumi-jev/index.md",
      "found_by": [
        "llm-atomic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_range": "L195",
      "text": "In GeoDeploy, the confidence threshold for the ingress or autoscaling module is 0.85, and failing it uses the registry default.",
