      "found_by": [
        "llm-atomic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_range": "L219",
      "text": "Each AiPathAborted error in GeoDeploy carries the full attempt (state, questions, and answers), so even a rejected answer ends up in the audit trail.",
      "type": "behavior",
      "source_hint": "pulumi/devx-geodeploy",
      "confidence": "high",
      "file": "content/blog/self-driving-infrastructure-pulumi-jev/index.md",
      "found_by": [
        "llm-atomic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_range": "L221",
      "text": "If a gate check fails, the API times out or returns an error, or the upstream can't be reached, GeoDeploy switches to a deterministic fallback that compares prices across providers while still enforcing residency and constraint checks.",
      "type": "behavior",
      "source_hint": "pulumi/devx-geodeploy",
