        "llm-atomic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_range": "L225",
      "text": "In self-driving mode, the agent periodically checks each deployment's CPU utilization and asks Jev one joint question across all regions, with possible answers no-change, scale-up:<geo>, scale-down:<geo>, or shift:<from>-><to>, plus a separate check on disruption risk.",
